From c2cf310c4fd64694927726a5570290e69929bc4f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AMB-1 FM6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 15:04:08 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] 1.4.2: the screen's look: each page an album's colours, a
 bitmap face, the reel's spools as circles

- a palette a page, after the records of Aphex Twin (their colours only: no names, no marks): the garden black and
  white with a few gold details, voice 1 rust and gold, voice 2 warm orange on black, voice 3 green, the space a
  blue sky, setup steel grey and yellow, the reel's five pages beige paper
- the reel's spools as the circles on the back of Selected Ambient Works Volume II: a thin ring, three uneven
  spokes turning with the tape, the tape wound on it a pale disc; the left olive, the right copper
- the fonts Terminus (bitmap, OFL, in fm1-base): X0X_FONTSET=terminus in build.sh

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
